venue per employee of $800K ranks in the below the sector median among Energy peers, improving at 15%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Stock-based compensation of $18K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 4\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (4/10).","financial_summary":["Dorian LPG Ltd. is a small-cap energy business with a $2.0B market cap on $482M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +7% over the past three years, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 11% against a 8% cost of capital, a 3-point spread that creates value, though narrow enough that competitive pressure could close it.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.8\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage runs at 7.2\u00d7.","Management returns a meaningful 5.6% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insiders hold 14% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and within its sector the business captures 4.0\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 5.8% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $9.5M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Cyclical sectors like Energy tend to underperform in slowdowns","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"The commodity cycle \u2014 revenue and free cash flow are ultimately hostage to a price the company does not set, and the long-run energy-transition arc adds a structural overhang.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"ESG-driven capital flight and stranded asset risk \u2014 tightening climate policy and investor mandates raise the cost of capital and risk leaving reserves permanently in the ground.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Geopolitical supply shocks \u2014 wars, sanctions, and OPEC decisions create volatility that no hedging programme can fully neutralise.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 28% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment","Energy sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 6% over 3 months","Energy ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Dorian LPG Ltd (LPG) (Q2 2027) Earnings Call Highlights: Record TC Rates, $242 Million EBITDA ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/dorian-lpg-ltd-lpg-q2-150912513.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793977752.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.681,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Dorian LPG Stock In Focus After Earnings Beat And Irregular Dividend","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/energy/nyse-lpg/doriang/news/dorian-lpg-stock-in-focus-after-earnings-beat-and-irregular","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793968462.43,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.859,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings","dividend"]},{"title":"Dorian LPG Stock In Focus After Earnings Surge And $1.25 Dividend","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/s