nance pace."],"own":["Insiders own 14.0%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 75%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (12 sales, net $9.5M sold).","It returns 5.6% a year to shareholders (0.4% in buybacks and 7.2% in dividends).","The share count has grown 1.4% a year over five years, diluting existing holders."],"people":["With about 602 employees, each generates about $800K of revenue, 0.4x the Energy median, and productivity has risen 14.9% a year.","CEO pay is $3.4M (4x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $18K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":79,"head":"Watch: LEAN BUY-rated, but only 7% below fair value; it becomes a buy below $42.61.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 40, gates 11/26)","Revenue grew 8.8%/yr over 5y","Net debt/EBITDA 0.8x","P/E 4.1x vs sector 13.4x","5 analysts' mean target $56.60 (+22%)"],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":["only 7% below fair value"],"buy_below":42.61,"vc":{"base":50.13,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":50.13,"n_alt":3,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.0105,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":13.3952,"ev_ebitda":6.86,"pfcf":14.299,"pb":1.6885,"roic":0.0952,"gross_margin":0.2462,"fcf_margin":0.0754,"div_yield":0.0371}},"ticker":"LPG","date":"2026-11-06"}